// -----------------------------------------------------------------
// Bead `sts2-rs-8z3fl.4` — start-of-combat parity coverage
// -----------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Sibling tests above pin spec constants + dispatch reachability.
// These three tests pin **observable state mutations** at the
// start-of-combat fan-out, mirroring the Python pin's behaviour
// step-by-step:
//
// - Anchor: `before_combat_start` → +10 block on the player.
// - BagOfMarbles: round-1 `before_side_turn_start(Player)` →
//   Vulnerable +1 on every alive enemy (multi-target ordering).
// - BurningBlood: `after_combat_victory` → +6 HP on the player
//   (existing sibling test `burning_blood_heals_six_after_combat_victory`
//   covers this; the multi-relic ordering test below exercises it
//   alongside Anchor to lock the cross-hook fan-out).

/// Anchor: `before_combat_start` grants 10 block to the player.
/// Python pin: `sts2-rl-agent@01c094d:sts2_env/relics/common.py::Anchor`.
